1
00:00:06,117 --> 00:00:10,140
In eastern Tibet, the
story goes, a master dies.

2
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:13,591
His students wrap the body
and leave it in a small room.

3
00:00:13,671 --> 00:00:15,982
Over a week the body grows smaller.

4
00:00:16,062 --> 00:00:18,102
Rainbows are seen over the house.

5
00:00:18,182 --> 00:00:22,182
When the room is opened, only
the hair and the nails are left.

6
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:24,190
Here is the puzzle.

7
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:29,190
The same tradition says that nothing is
found from its own side. Not the self.

8
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:31,676
Not the body. Not even the mind.

9
00:00:31,756 --> 00:00:35,132
So if nothing is found,
what turns into light?

10
00:00:35,933 --> 00:00:41,047
This is After Anatta: notes by
John Tan, known as Thusness.

11
00:00:41,865 --> 00:00:46,268
Two Tibetan schools hold a view that
leaves nothing standing on its own.

12
00:00:46,348 --> 00:00:48,714
Dzogchen, the Great Perfection.

13
00:00:48,794 --> 00:00:51,391
And the Gelug school of Tsongkhapa.

14
00:00:51,471 --> 00:00:54,733
Both say that practice can
change the body itself.

15
00:00:54,813 --> 00:00:56,893
The answer in one line is this.

16
00:00:56,973 --> 00:00:59,978
The body is not a lump
that stands by itself.

17
00:01:00,058 --> 00:01:04,679
It is held together by grasping,
through the energy grasping rides on.

18
00:01:04,759 --> 00:01:07,437
When grasping ends at its subtlest level,

19
00:01:07,517 --> 00:01:10,091
the form it held is freed as well.

20
00:01:10,909 --> 00:01:12,962
Start with what both schools share.

21
00:01:13,042 --> 00:01:16,467
The body is dependently
arisen, like the mind.

22
00:01:16,547 --> 00:01:19,891
It is a stream of elements, earth, water,

23
00:01:19,971 --> 00:01:24,008
fire, air and space,
holding each other in place.

24
00:01:24,088 --> 00:01:26,535
Mind and energy move together.

25
00:01:26,615 --> 00:01:28,845
The tantras call the energy wind.

26
00:01:28,925 --> 00:01:30,897
Every thought moves on a wind.

27
00:01:30,977 --> 00:01:33,451
And grasping keeps the body heavy.

28
00:01:33,531 --> 00:01:37,812
It drives the winds through the side
channels and locks the elements into a

29
00:01:37,892 --> 00:01:41,227
solid body that seems
to be there by itself.

30
00:01:42,041 --> 00:01:46,241
Now the first school. In Dzogchen
the ground has three aspects.

31
00:01:46,321 --> 00:01:50,059
Its essence is empty,
pure from the beginning.

32
00:01:50,139 --> 00:01:53,523
Its nature is clear,
spontaneously present.

33
00:01:53,603 --> 00:01:55,806
And its energy never stops showing.

34
00:01:55,886 --> 00:01:58,691
That showing first appears as five lights.

35
00:01:59,493 --> 00:02:01,097
Then comes the key step.

36
00:02:01,177 --> 00:02:04,780
When the display is not
recognised as its own radiance,

37
00:02:04,860 --> 00:02:10,038
it is taken as something other, standing
over there. The lights are grasped.

38
00:02:10,118 --> 00:02:12,538
They harden into the five elements.

39
00:02:12,618 --> 00:02:15,676
And from the elements come
the body and the world.

40
00:02:15,756 --> 00:02:20,432
So in this view, the ordinary
body is light not recognised.

41
00:02:20,512 --> 00:02:24,417
The rainbow body is the
same process run backwards.

42
00:02:25,238 --> 00:02:28,745
There are two practices. The
first is called cutting through.

43
00:02:28,825 --> 00:02:34,112
You recognise the knowing that is empty
and clear at once, and you rest in that.

44
00:02:34,192 --> 00:02:36,490
This frees the mind from grasping.

45
00:02:36,570 --> 00:02:38,854
The second is called direct crossing.

46
00:02:38,934 --> 00:02:40,946
It works with the display itself.

47
00:02:41,026 --> 00:02:45,702
Lights appear in open space,
and unfold through four visions,

48
00:02:45,782 --> 00:02:49,234
until the fourth, the
exhaustion of phenomena.

49
00:02:49,314 --> 00:02:52,359
Every appearance is freed as it arises.

50
00:02:52,439 --> 00:02:56,725
Nothing is grasped as solid
any more, the body included.

51
00:02:57,546 --> 00:02:58,757
But careful here.

52
00:02:58,837 --> 00:03:03,988
The shrinking body is what people see, and
it is easy to take it for the rainbow body

53
00:03:04,068 --> 00:03:08,118
itself. Teachers inside
Dzogchen warn against this.

54
00:03:08,198 --> 00:03:11,094
The rainbow body is first a realization.

55
00:03:11,174 --> 00:03:15,551
When the fourth vision is complete,
everything is seen as the display of the

56
00:03:15,631 --> 00:03:20,972
five lights. The corpse is only a sign
of it, and not always a sign at all.

57
00:03:21,052 --> 00:03:24,260
A body that shrinks is
a partial rainbow body.

58
00:03:24,340 --> 00:03:27,426
And control of the elements
is a worldly power,

59
00:03:27,506 --> 00:03:30,333
which yogis of other
traditions can gain too.

60
00:03:30,413 --> 00:03:35,143
As the advice on Awakening
to Reality put it in 2013,

61
00:03:35,223 --> 00:03:39,101
the rainbow body does not mean
that your body disappears.

62
00:03:39,921 --> 00:03:41,267
Now the second school.

63
00:03:41,347 --> 00:03:46,362
Gelug does not teach direct crossing,
and it does not aim at a rainbow body.

64
00:03:46,442 --> 00:03:51,539
Its view is Tsongkhapa's middle way:
nothing exists from its own side,

65
00:03:51,619 --> 00:03:54,637
and everything works as
a dependent designation.

66
00:03:54,717 --> 00:03:58,129
The view alone changes
the body only slowly.

67
00:03:58,209 --> 00:04:02,359
The fast path is tantra, because
it works with the subtle body.

68
00:04:03,184 --> 00:04:05,251
The tantra rests on one point.

69
00:04:05,331 --> 00:04:08,987
Mind and wind are one
thing seen from two sides.

70
00:04:09,067 --> 00:04:13,593
At the subtlest level they are the very
subtle wind and the very subtle mind of

71
00:04:13,673 --> 00:04:16,718
clear light. Everyone meets this at death.

72
00:04:16,798 --> 00:04:19,761
The elements dissolve, one into the next.

73
00:04:19,841 --> 00:04:24,965
Then come three appearances, white,
red and black. Then the clear light.

74
00:04:25,045 --> 00:04:29,100
Most of us do not recognise
it, and habit carries us on.

75
00:04:29,934 --> 00:04:32,341
The yogi rehearses this while alive.

76
00:04:32,421 --> 00:04:36,743
The winds are drawn into the central
channel and dissolve at the heart.

77
00:04:36,823 --> 00:04:39,777
Thought stops, and the clear light dawns.

78
00:04:39,866 --> 00:04:42,830
From the subtle wind that
carried that clear light,

79
00:04:42,910 --> 00:04:47,150
a body of pure wind arises,
in the form of the deity.

80
00:04:47,230 --> 00:04:51,145
This is the illusory body,
separate from the coarse body,

81
00:04:51,225 --> 00:04:53,468
like a dream body but stable.

82
00:04:53,548 --> 00:04:56,689
When the clear light
sees emptiness directly,

83
00:04:56,769 --> 00:05:01,231
and the two are joined, that
union is the body of a buddha.

84
00:05:02,037 --> 00:05:03,084
Why does it work?

85
00:05:03,164 --> 00:05:08,193
Because the body's material is
wind, and wind is one with mind.

86
00:05:08,273 --> 00:05:14,273
When the subtlest mind sees emptiness, the
wind it rides on comes out as a pure body,

87
00:05:14,401 --> 00:05:15,978
not a body of karma.

88
00:05:16,058 --> 00:05:18,152
And Gelug insists on one thing.

89
00:05:18,232 --> 00:05:20,693
The clear light must see emptiness.

90
00:05:20,773 --> 00:05:24,583
Clarity alone, however
deep, frees nothing.

91
00:05:25,406 --> 00:05:27,949
The sign Gelug is known for is tukdam.

92
00:05:28,029 --> 00:05:31,060
After death a master
rests in the clear light,

93
00:05:31,140 --> 00:05:34,606
sometimes for days, and
the body stays fresh.

94
00:05:34,686 --> 00:05:39,796
A study in 2021 found no detectable
brain activity in such cases,

95
00:05:39,876 --> 00:05:42,201
measured from about a day after death.

96
00:05:42,281 --> 00:05:45,494
It tested the brain, not
the claim about the body.

97
00:05:46,314 --> 00:05:49,731
So the two schools say one
thing in two languages.

98
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:54,047
Form is the display, or the
mount, of the subtlest knowing.

99
00:05:54,127 --> 00:05:58,752
When that knowing is freed by
emptiness, the form is freed with it.

100
00:05:59,553 --> 00:06:01,850
Now a closer look at the five lights.

101
00:06:01,930 --> 00:06:03,671
What exactly is the light?

102
00:06:03,751 --> 00:06:06,524
The tantras answer through
the five aggregates:

103
00:06:06,604 --> 00:06:11,592
form, feeling, perception,
formations and consciousness.

104
00:06:11,672 --> 00:06:16,239
Each aggregate, freed, is
one of five buddha families,

105
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:19,405
each with its own wisdom
and its own colour.

106
00:06:19,485 --> 00:06:24,079
After death, the texts say,
each appears as a bright light,

107
00:06:24,159 --> 00:06:28,535
and beside it a dull, soft
light that leads to rebirth.

108
00:06:28,615 --> 00:06:31,850
The lights are not a sixth
thing beside the aggregates.

109
00:06:31,930 --> 00:06:35,043
They are the aggregates,
seen without grasping.

110
00:06:35,123 --> 00:06:38,526
The dull light is the
same aggregate, grasped.

111
00:06:39,352 --> 00:06:44,476
Hold an apple. The hardness, the
coolness, the red. That is form.

112
00:06:44,556 --> 00:06:47,397
The sweetness is
pleasant. That is feeling.

113
00:06:47,477 --> 00:06:51,147
The shape is recognised as
an apple. That is perception.

114
00:06:51,227 --> 00:06:54,938
Touch, seeing and tasting
each give their own appearing.

115
00:06:55,018 --> 00:06:58,987
That is consciousness,
many streams, unmixed,

116
00:06:59,067 --> 00:07:02,315
with no one gathering them
in. And then the knot.

117
00:07:02,395 --> 00:07:06,432
A mental formation, from the
habits of the inherent framework,

118
00:07:06,512 --> 00:07:10,739
ties the separate appearings
into one solid apple out there,

119
00:07:10,819 --> 00:07:12,913
with a me in here holding it.

120
00:07:12,993 --> 00:07:15,377
That is the aggregate of formations.

121
00:07:16,220 --> 00:07:18,015
Here the two languages meet.

122
00:07:18,095 --> 00:07:23,952
In Dzogchen's words, the display taken
as other hardens into a solid world.

123
00:07:24,032 --> 00:07:28,762
In the apple's words, the habit ties
the appearings into a thing out there.

124
00:07:28,842 --> 00:07:33,409
It is one movement, told once from the
side of the lights and once from the side

125
00:07:33,489 --> 00:07:34,689
of the view.

126
00:07:35,229 --> 00:07:37,975
Untie the knot, and nothing is lost.

127
00:07:38,055 --> 00:07:41,901
Just this hardness, this
red, this sweetness,

128
00:07:41,981 --> 00:07:45,108
vivid, appearing as their conditions meet.

129
00:07:45,188 --> 00:07:47,676
The body is held the
way the apple is held.

130
00:07:47,756 --> 00:07:53,464
Hardness, warmth, weight and the felt
sense of mine are tied into one solid

131
00:07:53,544 --> 00:07:54,836
body in here.

132
00:07:54,916 --> 00:08:00,149
The rainbow body, in essence, is
that knot untied all the way through,

133
00:08:00,229 --> 00:08:01,688
the body included.

134
00:08:02,497 --> 00:08:04,591
Now, read with dependency.

135
00:08:04,671 --> 00:08:08,096
None of this needs a ground,
and none of it proves one.

136
00:08:08,176 --> 00:08:10,895
Clarity is never missing from the body.

137
00:08:10,975 --> 00:08:13,925
The error is lifting it
out and making it a thing.

138
00:08:14,005 --> 00:08:19,591
Dissolving into the light of the ground is
easily heard as going back into a luminous

139
00:08:19,671 --> 00:08:21,697
stuff beneath everything.

140
00:08:21,777 --> 00:08:25,284
Read that way it is a substrate.
But the ground is empty.

141
00:08:25,364 --> 00:08:29,305
The five lights are a display,
not a stuff the world is made of.

142
00:08:29,385 --> 00:08:30,963
And nothing is produced.

143
00:08:31,043 --> 00:08:35,188
When the conditions that kept the
elements coarse no longer come together,

144
00:08:35,268 --> 00:08:37,865
the coarse body no longer appears.

145
00:08:37,945 --> 00:08:42,584
The way a flame goes out when
wick, wax and air no longer meet.

146
00:08:43,397 --> 00:08:44,580
Is this logical?

147
00:08:44,660 --> 00:08:49,227
Put plainly: how can purifying the
aggregates turn a physical body into

148
00:08:49,307 --> 00:08:52,583
light? It depends on what
the body is taken to be.

149
00:08:52,663 --> 00:08:56,034
If the body is matter that
is there from its own side,

150
00:08:56,114 --> 00:08:59,309
and the aggregates are only
what goes on in a mind,

151
00:08:59,389 --> 00:09:03,982
then purifying the mind cannot reach
the body. Nothing joins the two.

152
00:09:04,062 --> 00:09:07,818
Read that way, it is not
logical. It sounds like magic.

153
00:09:08,638 --> 00:09:10,379
But neither school starts there.

154
00:09:10,459 --> 00:09:12,734
The body is one of the aggregates.

155
00:09:12,837 --> 00:09:14,659
Form is the first of the five.

156
00:09:14,739 --> 00:09:19,577
So purifying the aggregates is not
a mind working on a body outside it.

157
00:09:19,657 --> 00:09:22,539
It is the whole way
experience is put together,

158
00:09:22,619 --> 00:09:25,189
coming loose, the body included.

159
00:09:25,269 --> 00:09:29,754
And the body's solidity is partly
the knot's work, as with the apple.

160
00:09:29,834 --> 00:09:33,599
Untie the knot, and that
hardness has nothing to stand on.

161
00:09:33,679 --> 00:09:37,693
What depends on a condition does
not stay when the condition is gone.

162
00:09:38,509 --> 00:09:40,630
Now, where the logic stops.

163
00:09:40,710 --> 00:09:43,700
This shows how the body
is known and lived.

164
00:09:43,780 --> 00:09:47,002
It does not show that other
people will see a corpse shrink.

165
00:09:47,082 --> 00:09:50,793
A body as others see it also
depends on physical causes,

166
00:09:50,873 --> 00:09:53,605
and on the senses and
habits of those who look.

167
00:09:53,685 --> 00:09:56,934
One person's realization
does not remove those.

168
00:09:57,014 --> 00:10:00,018
So a vanishing corpse
is a report to weigh,

169
00:10:00,098 --> 00:10:02,084
not a conclusion of the logic.

170
00:10:02,164 --> 00:10:06,327
Read as a realization, the rainbow
body follows from the view.

171
00:10:07,158 --> 00:10:09,415
Buddhism is not alone in this.

172
00:10:09,495 --> 00:10:14,782
In Taoist inner alchemy, the
practitioner refines essence into energy,

173
00:10:14,862 --> 00:10:18,980
energy into spirit, and
spirit back into emptiness.

174
00:10:19,060 --> 00:10:24,143
The aim is the yang spirit, a body
outside the body that others can see.

175
00:10:24,224 --> 00:10:28,926
A spirit that only you can see,
made by working on the mind alone,

176
00:10:29,006 --> 00:10:30,788
is called the yin spirit.

177
00:10:30,868 --> 00:10:33,804
Mind alone, they say, is not enough.

178
00:10:33,884 --> 00:10:36,114
That is the same point Dzogchen makes.

179
00:10:36,194 --> 00:10:37,785
And the endings are close.

180
00:10:37,865 --> 00:10:40,991
In one, the body vanishes from the coffin,

181
00:10:41,071 --> 00:10:43,885
leaving only clothes or a staff.

182
00:10:43,965 --> 00:10:48,537
In another, the master rises in
broad daylight, without dying.

183
00:10:49,354 --> 00:10:52,087
The method is close. The view is not.

184
00:10:52,167 --> 00:10:56,095
The Dao is a source to return
to. The goal is not to die.

185
00:10:56,175 --> 00:10:59,931
And what is made is a self,
refined until it lasts.

186
00:11:00,758 --> 00:11:02,784
The Chan tradition said it sharply.

187
00:11:02,864 --> 00:11:07,974
The immortal Lü Dongbin visits the Chan
master Huanglong and boasts of his elixir

188
00:11:08,054 --> 00:11:12,091
of long life. Huanglong calls
him a corpse-guarding ghost.

189
00:11:12,171 --> 00:11:15,787
Even if you last eighty
thousand aeons, he says,

190
00:11:15,867 --> 00:11:18,178
in the end you fall into ruin.

191
00:11:18,258 --> 00:11:20,339
In the story, Lü wakes up.

192
00:11:20,419 --> 00:11:25,298
A body of light still guarded as me
is still a corpse-guarding ghost,

193
00:11:25,378 --> 00:11:27,571
only a very refined one.

194
00:11:28,386 --> 00:11:30,317
The same pattern runs elsewhere.

195
00:11:30,397 --> 00:11:35,847
A Tamil saint locks himself in a
room in 1874 and is never found.

196
00:11:35,927 --> 00:11:39,217
Christian monks speak of
the light of Mount Tabor.

197
00:11:39,297 --> 00:11:41,649
Sufis speak of a man of light.

198
00:11:41,729 --> 00:11:46,354
Almost all of them read the result
through something that stands by itself:

199
00:11:46,443 --> 00:11:49,923
a soul that survives,
a source to return to,

200
00:11:50,003 --> 00:11:51,721
a self made perfect.

201
00:11:52,534 --> 00:11:54,180
Buddhism expected this.

202
00:11:54,260 --> 00:11:57,943
In the early teaching, five
of the six higher knowledges,

203
00:11:58,023 --> 00:12:01,082
the powers and the bodily
wonders among them,

204
00:12:01,162 --> 00:12:03,106
are shared with other paths.

205
00:12:03,186 --> 00:12:06,911
Only the sixth, the ending
of the taints, frees.

206
00:12:06,991 --> 00:12:10,131
So a changed body shows
that energy was mastered.

207
00:12:10,211 --> 00:12:12,608
It does not show that grasping has ended.

208
00:12:13,429 --> 00:12:17,873
A few cautions. The rainbow body
is not the measure of insight.

209
00:12:17,953 --> 00:12:21,066
Many great masters left ordinary bodies.

210
00:12:21,146 --> 00:12:25,101
The stories cannot be checked; most
come from those who were there.

211
00:12:25,181 --> 00:12:27,072
And it is not a goal to grasp.

212
00:12:27,152 --> 00:12:31,356
To practise for a body of light is
still to practise for something.

213
00:12:32,177 --> 00:12:35,847
So, if nothing is found,
what turns into light?

214
00:12:35,927 --> 00:12:38,292
Nothing found turns into light.

215
00:12:38,372 --> 00:12:41,186
The body appeared as
solid because it was held.

216
00:12:41,266 --> 00:12:44,601
When the holding ends,
it no longer appears so.

217
00:12:45,432 --> 00:12:49,944
Hold the apple again. The
hardness. The red. The sweetness.

218
00:12:50,024 --> 00:12:53,015
Each vivid, each following its conditions.

219
00:12:53,095 --> 00:12:54,700
Not tied into anything.

220
00:12:54,780 --> 00:12:57,580
The yang spirit is a self made perfect.

221
00:12:57,660 --> 00:13:00,451
The rainbow body is
the end of the holding.

